  <!-- EN: [faction_name] became hostile. The first-outpost request has failed. -->
  <TSA_WD_FirstOutpost_LetterTextHostile>[faction_name]已轉為敵對。建立首座哨站的請求失敗了。</TSA_WD_FirstOutpost_LetterTextHostile>
  <!-- EN: First outpost quest -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableFirstOutpost>首座哨站任務</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableFirstOutpost>
  <!-- EN: After 2-5 days, a nearby ally or neutral settlement may ask you to found your first WD outpost. Completing it grants goodwill. Off stops new offers; an active quest can still finish. -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableFirstOutpostTip>開局2-5天後，附近的同盟或中立據點可能請你建立第一座WD哨站，完成可獲得友好度。關閉後不再發出新任務；進行中的任務仍可完成。</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableFirstOutpostTip>
  <!-- EN: Common-enemy settlement quest -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableCommonEnemySettlement>共同敵人據點任務</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableCommonEnemySettlement>
  <!-- EN: After day 10, allies (or neutrals) may ask you to wipe or conquer a nearby town hostile to both of you. Credit only counts for your own outpost raids or fighting there in person. Allied raid orders and other factions wiping the town do not count. Off stops new offers; an active quest can still finish. -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableCommonEnemySettlementTip>第10天起，同盟（或中立）派系可能請你剷除或征服附近一座與雙方皆敵對的城鎮。只有從你自己的哨站發動的突襲，或你親自前往作戰才算數；同盟突襲命令及其他派系剷除該城鎮都不算。關閉後不再發出新任務；進行中的任務仍可完成。</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableCommonEnemySettlementTip>
  <!-- EN: Colony road-link quest -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableColonyRoadLink>殖民地道路連通任務</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableColonyRoadLink>
  <!-- EN: After day 10, a nearby ally or neutral town (within 30 tiles) may ask for a road between your colony and theirs. Connecting the towns by any road completes it once for good. Failures (timeout, hostility, or the town vanishing) can reissue after a few days. Off stops new offers; an active quest can still finish. -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableColonyRoadLinkTip>第10天起，附近（30格內）的同盟或中立城鎮可能請求在你的殖民地與他們之間修一條路。以任何道路連通兩地即永久完成。失敗（逾時、轉為敵對或城鎮消失）後，數天後可能再次發出。關閉後不再發出新任務；進行中的任務仍可完成。</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableColonyRoadLinkTip>
  <!-- EN: World Domination victory quest -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableWorldDominationVictory>World Domination勝利任務</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableWorldDominationVictory>
  <!-- EN: After 4-6 days, offers a long-term goal: hold the top WD ranking for 15 continuous days. Turning this on mid-game starts the quest immediately. Turning it off removes an active quest immediately. -->
  <TSA_WD_Quest_EnableWorldDominationVictoryTip>開局4-6天後提供一個長期目標：連續15天保持WD排名第一。遊戲中途開啟會立即發出任務；關閉會立即移除進行中的任務。</TSA_WD_Quest_EnableWorldDominationVictoryTip>
